들어가 있을 거예요\n더 정확한 건 세무사님께 문의해보시는게 좋을 것 같습니다!","u":"aeaf680f"},{"i":"a36ec09242","t":"23:49:45","s":"윤@희(대기만성777)","k":"etc","x":"예 잘알겠습니다 \n설명 고맙습니다^^\n늘 건강하십시요^^\n대기만성 올림","u":"b22df7bc"},{"i":"50b8e3418e","t":"23:49:54","s":"김@희(빅파이)","k":"etc","x":"얼른 지나가요~\nhttps://cafe.naver.com/dinohighclass/489247","u":"a34a7ccd"},{"i":"2c6323e82b","t":"23:52:37","s":"이@원(랄랄라아아)","k":"etc","x":"https://cafe.naver.com/dinohighclass/489262","u":"5ae609ba"},{"i":"93942b4cfb","t":"23:53:25","s":"이@연(춘짱이)","k":"etc","x":"시도남님 너무 감사드립니다!!","u":"ec7015e6"},{"i":"ea8f31cda1","t":"23:55:06","s":"김@미(월천해봄)","k":"etc","x":"https://cafe.naver.com/dinohighclass/489271","u":"16dd7a18"},{"i":"fe7cfb10fa","t":"23:58:21","s":"서@미(머니또)","k":"etc","x":"https://cafe.naver.com/dinohighclass/489290","u":"cf15633a"},{"i":"2f78227726","t":"23:59:05","s":"황@호(도파민렉카)","k":"etc","x":"https://cafe.naver.com/dinohighclass/489287","u":"488c28f7"},{"i":"072b1bbfa1","t":"23:59:19","s":"민@라(괴도귤팡)","k":"etc","x":"https://cafe.naver.com/dinohighclass/489278","u":"24732a55"},{"i":"b1b2d04302","t":"23:59:34","s":"임@민(엔쪽이)","k":"etc","x":"우왓 시도남님 감사합니다","u":"6fc33bd1"}]}